20/#skinny-machos-set) to bring in the new decade. \n<!--more-->\n\n#### Jump to:\n\n- [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#joe-kays-set)\n- [Sasha Marie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#sasha-maries-set)\n- [Budgie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set)\n- [Skinny Macho's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set)\n\nAlso listen to [Soulection All Day 2019](/episodes/all-day-2019/).\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-01-01T14:41:45+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"kov8edhRdlg","position":57,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Quasimoto - Low Class Conspiracy","track":{"id":"Ar8UYiwyGeE","path":"/artists/quasimoto/tracks/low-class-conspiracy/","slug":"low-class-conspiracy","title":"Low Class Conspiracy","artist":{"slug":"quasimoto","title":"Quasimoto"},"artwork":"images/artists/quasimoto/tracks/low-class-conspiracy.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"uvJZqSGqvgU","slug":"boilerroom-streaming-from-isolation-14","tags":[6,3],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/joekay/jboiler-room-streaming-from-isolation-14"},"state":"published","title":"Boilerroom - Joe Kay 4 hour Streaming from Isolation #14","artwork":null,"content":"Joe Kay appears on BoilerRoom Live Streaming from Isolation sessions.\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\n[Please support here if you can.](https://business.facebook.com/donate/219168332618496/)\n\nDuring the pandemic, tune into our new live series Streaming From Isolation. These broadcasts will stream from artists’ homes and private spaces, direct to our audience and without the need for interaction with production teams - as we practice social distancing to remove risk from our programming.\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-04-10T20:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's 4 hour experiance","position":0}},{"id":"wMOzpbPVwC4","position":58,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Quasimoto - Bad Character","track":{"id":"0AMySplCJlI","path":"/artists/quasimoto/tracks/bad-character/","slug":"bad-character","title":"Bad Character","artist":{"slug":"quasimoto","title":"Quasimoto"},"artwork":"images/artists/quasimoto/tracks/bad-character.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"uvJZqSGqvgU","slug":"boilerroom-streaming-from-isolation-14","tags":[6,3],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/joekay/jboiler-room-streaming-from-isolation-14"},"state":"published","title":"Boilerroom - Joe Kay 4 hour Streaming from Isolation #14","artwork":null,"content":"Joe Kay appears on BoilerRoom Live Streaming from Isolation sessions.\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\n[Please support here if you can.](https://business.facebook.com/donate/219168332618496/)\n\nDuring the pandemic, tune into our new live series Streaming From Isolation. These broadcasts will stream from artists’ homes and private spaces, direct to our audience and without the need for interaction with production teams - as we practice social distancing to remove risk from our programming.\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-04-10T20:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's 4 hour experiance","position":0}},{"id":"20Ms-B3heUg","position":43,"timestamp":"01:50:02","rawTrack":"Quasimoto - Bad Character","track":{"id":"0AMySplCJlI","path":"/artists/quasimoto/tracks/bad-character/","slug":"bad-character","title":"Bad Character","artist":{"slug":"quasimoto","title":"Quasimoto"},"artwork":"images/artists/quasimoto/tracks/bad-character.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"dG-WJSO8ksU","slug":"544","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-544/ra.1616082171","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-544"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #544","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-544.jpg","content":"A music session with tunes from Buddy, Koffee, and Quasimoto.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-04-09T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"eWbA7NBB3iE","position":6,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Quasimoto - Bluffin' (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"2ebdD5nnu7A","path":"/artists/quasimoto/tracks/bluffin-instrumental/","slug":"bluffin-instrumental","title":"Bluffin' (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"quasimoto","title":"Quasimoto"},"artwork":"images/artists/quasimoto/tracks/bluffin-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"brFh4QBhAJE","slug":"167","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-167"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #167","artwork":"/images/episodes/167.jpg","content":"Take a deep breath and slow things down with Joe Kay\n<!--more-->\n\nSo many good things have been going on in our world but sometimes it is overwhelming. However we just take a deep breath and keep it moving. This week Joe Kay wanted to slow things down a bit and just focus on the music by going solo. Joe started off with some nice neo-soul/Dilla-esque vibes and then progressed into some progressive beats to get your energy flowing. Standout artists to look out for are LOSCO. These guys have a heavy, heavy sound. Just wait til you hear. As the show progressed the engagement via social media was massive and a few people randomly requested to hear a Sango tribute so we did one! Joe dropped a 42 minute set of primarily unreleased music to keep things interesting! We hope you enjoy the show and feel free to spread it to as many people as possible. Real radio is here.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10845,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-03-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"Hcwf0rYWS4s","position":9,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Quasimoto - Greenery (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"62thDzukJdo","path":"/artists/quasimoto/tracks/greenery-instrumental/","slug":"greenery-instrumental","tit